			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance submodule to v2.11.2 baseline\n\nUpdate the Tauri dependency submodule pointer from aba71a52 to ba584821 to align with the upstream v2.11.2 release cycle.\n\nThis update synchronizes 11 internal Tauri ecosystem submodules, migrating plugin bindings (Autostart, Store, WindowState) from v1 to v2 API signatures to ensure compatibility with the Mountain backend's IPC mechanisms. Key technical updates include bumping `@tauri-apps/api` to v2.11.0, upgrading tooling to TypeScript v6, ESLint v10, and Vite v8, and aligning framework versions (TauriStudio to Quasar v2/Vue v3, TauriTheia to v1.71.1, VueCLIPluginTauri to Vue v5).\n\nAll submodules are now synchronized to their latest upstream revisions, resolving deprecation warnings and ensuring the Land editor's dependency tree matches the current Tauri stable release.",
			"SHA": "fc2d691bddf9586f2dd743b6023b800023ba47b5"
